      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869844332544
    m_Localized: Press A or D to rotate the terrain!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109760
    m_Localized: Right-click to zoom in!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109761
    m_Localized: Find a termite and report it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109762
    m_Localized: Let's go find a termite, shall we?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109763
    m_Localized: There was a termite right in front! Left-click to report it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109764
    m_Localized: "One might be hiding at an angle you can't see \u2014 press A or
      D to look around!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109765
    m_Localized: A termite was hiding there! Report it the same way!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109766
    m_Localized: Right-click to zoom in! Just remember, you'll only see that one
      spot!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109767
    m_Localized: Report this one too!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109768
    m_Localized: Now, shall we do this for real?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109769
    m_Localized: Yahoo! Found one!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109770
    m_Localized: So that's where it was hiding!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109771
    m_Localized: You can't hide from my eyes!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109772
    m_Localized: Sloppy, for a spy! Haha!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109773
    m_Localized: Found you! How dare you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109774
    m_Localized: That doesn't seem right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109775
    m_Localized: No false reports!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109776
    m_Localized: Let's look somewhere else.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109777
    m_Localized: We have to hurry and catch the termite before it gets away!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109778
    m_Localized: Oops, my mistake!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109779
    m_Localized: Hey, how rude!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109780
    m_Localized: U-um, that's not me...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109781
    m_Localized: ...What are you looking at?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109782
    m_Localized: I'm a black ant, thank you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109783
    m_Localized: What do you think you're doing!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109784
    m_Localized: Aaagh!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109785
    m_Localized: Why is it always us!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109786
    m_Localized: We termites are...!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109787
    m_Localized: A termite, hiding somewhere around here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109788
    m_Localized: Termites are savage and vicious.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109789
    m_Localized: Is something rotten around here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109790
    m_Localized: I hear the Queen has laid new young!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139869861109791
    m_Localized: I miss Dad, off at work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2143471572869120
    m_Localized: "TMI: Long ago, termites and ants are said to have gotten along
      just fine\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2143539789029376
    m_Localized: 'Tips: Spotted a termite? Report it right away!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2143600497385472
    m_Localized: 'Tips: Sometimes a very tiny termite shows up. Try zooming in!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2143639126925312
    m_Localized: "TMI: Maybe\u2026 there's a termite somewhere near you right now..?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2143718751592448
    m_Localized: 'Tips: Click certain objects and they''ll move! Termites have been
      hiding lately...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2145133427417088
    m_Localized: Emil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2145173894062080
    m_Localized: Teacher Ant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2145212414550016
    m_Localized: Student Ant1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2145257989857280
    m_Localized: Student Ant2
